{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685570/extras/a17cbd678fcecd4f326994ab333e226a.avif?t=1765554048\" width=597 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685570/extras/9ec07af6ef9e59c59090e9eff017efa9.poster.avif?t=1765554048\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685570/extras/9ec07af6ef9e59c59090e9eff017efa9.webm?t=1765554048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the New World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the beautiful, immense lands of Mesoamerica! This interconnected world blends real-world, historical locations. A love letter to our rich legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685570/extras/530a3278222e65251a72c142f7cac544.poster.avif?t=1765554048\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685570/extras/530a3278222e65251a72c142f7cac544.webm?t=1765554048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wield your halberd!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've seen lots of laser guns and swords. Even whips! But... Halberds? Man, that's such a cool and underrated weapon for video games! Ideal for pogos!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Comicvania!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comic art style blends into gameplay with a well integrated interface. The player is always in control in this comic book!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Our influences</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We got several influences from games we love, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Half-Life 2 - Open storytelling, so the player is always playing!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Metroid - Great atmosphere in an interconnected world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hollow Knight - Aerial combat through pogo-system!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Europa Universalis - Attention to detail when dealing with History!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comix Zone - A diegetic use of comic art style in order to bring a unique experience.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Commitment to historical fidelity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though Plus Ultra: Legado is a fictional story with some supernatural events, we have made a strong research to accurately represent each civilization, character, and historical event. In fact, it has been translated into Nahuatl.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colorfulness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most Metroidvanias are very dark. Which is great! But Plus Ultra: Legado wants to offer something different, something fresh.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open storytelling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many sidescrolling video games force you to stop playing when a textbox appears. This is not the case of Plus Ultra: Legado. Move freely and even abandon story events if desired!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find gold and buy upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are pieces of gold hidden all over this interconnected world. Traverse the land, explore each corner, and enhance your weapons.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Siesta is over","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2685570/a4e168619f703509be1c286ba3a38f1596b31fe7.jpg"},{"name":"Spanish dollar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2685570/141449b4195866252b3837e58aef7d82d154d022.jpg"},{"name":"Suc